      "summary": "Baitulmaal provides global humanitarian aid, emergency response, and orphan support designed to serve vulnerable communities in crisis zones <cite id=\"2\">through a zakat-eligible platform</cite>. In FY2024, the organization managed <cite id=\"3\">$77,434,379 in total revenue</cite>, supporting relief efforts across areas such as Gaza, Lebanon, Syria, Yemen, and Somalia. The organization holds a <cite id=\"1\">99/100 overall score from Charity Navigator</cite>, reflecting strong formal governance standards and fundraising efficiency. While the reported program expense ratio reaches 93.7%, cash-adjusted analysis shows a cash program expense ratio of 77.4% due to heavy non-cash gift utilization. Baitulmaal offers a direct way for Muslim donors to meet religious giving requirements in high-urgency regions.",
